{"ID":"20230720180557-uarfr3k","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230720180557-uarfr3k","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230720180557-uarfr3k\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230720180557-plctmo1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230720180846-ubsj0zy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230720180634-g2bqb75\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"UG2L15——Drawcall","type":"doc","updated":"20250918204415"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230720180557-plctmo1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20230720180557-plctmo1","updated":"20250918204415"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Drawcall"}]},{"ID":"20230720180629-w2nmpzl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230720180629-w2nmpzl","updated":"20250918203339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"字面理解 DrawCall  就是 绘制呼叫的意思  表示 CPU（中央处理器）通知GPU（图形处理器-显卡）"}]},{"ID":"20250918204355-ukpj291","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204355-ukpj291","updated":"20250918204415"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关于 DrawCall 更详细的介绍，参见："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250918203952-qf8vrst","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"UPL6-1——DrawCall"}]},{"ID":"20230720180634-g2bqb75","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20230720180634-g2bqb75","updated":"20250918203705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"DrawCall 的概念"}]},{"ID":"20230720180629-x21n5b7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230720180629-x21n5b7","updated":"20250918203552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"就是 CPU（处理器）准备好渲染数据（顶点，纹理，法线，Shader 等等）后\n告知 GPU（图形处理器 - 显卡）开始渲染（将命令放入命令缓冲区）的命令"}]},{"ID":"20230720180629-xwn5va0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230720180629-xwn5va0","updated":"20250918203557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"简单来说："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一次 DrawCall 就是 CPU 准备好渲染数据通知 GPU 渲染的这个过程"}]},{"ID":"20230720180629-fmdcxv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230720180629-fmdcxv5","updated":"20250918203601"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果游戏中 DrawCall 数量较高会影响 CPU 的效率，最直接的感受就是游戏会卡顿"}]},{"ID":"20230720180629-8ayh5jc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230720180629-8ayh5jc","updated":"20250918203622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"举例说明：\n以拷贝文件来进行类比，假设我们创建 10000 个小文件，每个文件大小为 1 kb，然后把这些文件拷贝到另一个文件夹中\n你会发现，即使这些文件加起来不超过 10 MB，但是拷贝花费的时间是很长的，\n如果我们单独创建 1 个 10 MB的文件拷贝到另一个文件夹，基本可以瞬间拷贝完毕"}]},{"ID":"20250918203624-pocaijx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918203624-pocaijx","updated":"20250918203632"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么会这样呢？因为每一个文件赋值动作都需要很多额外的操作，比如分配内存，创建数据等等\n这些操作就会带来一些额外的性能开销，简单理解，文件越多额外开销就越大"}]},{"ID":"20230720180629-lzodf8h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230720180629-lzodf8h","updated":"20250918203705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"渲染过程和上面的例子很类似，每次 DrawCall，CPU 都需要准备很多数据发送给 GPU\n那么如果 DrawCall 越多那么额外开销就越大，其实 GPU 的渲染效率是很强大的，往往影响渲染效率的，都是因为 CPU 提交命令的速度\n如果 DrawCall 太多，CPU 就会把大量时间花在提交 DrawCall 上 造成 CPU 过载，游戏卡顿"}]},{"ID":"20230720180751-dxydhoa","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20230720180751-dxydhoa","updated":"20250918203717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如何降低 DrawCall 数量"}]},{"ID":"20230720180800-7oj4fbu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230720180800-7oj4fbu","updated":"20250918203717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 UI 层面上：小图合大图——\u003e即多个小 DrawCall 变一次大 DrawCall"}]},{"ID":"20230720180817-mpu14op","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20230720180817-mpu14op","updated":"20250918204349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"制作 UI 时降低 DrawCall 的技巧"}]},{"ID":"20230720180846-ubsj0zy","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20230720180846-ubsj0zy","updated":"20250918203732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240321173915-rg31fdb","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240321173915-rg31fdb","updated":"20250918203729"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240321173915-grzndev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321173915-grzndev","updated":"20250918203729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通过 NGUI Panel 上提供的 DrawCall 查看工具"}]}]},{"ID":"20240321173915-86pgay7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20240321173915-86pgay7","updated":"20240321173915"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240321173915-4pp06ov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321173915-4pp06ov","updated":"20240321173915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意不同图集之间的层级关系"}]}]},{"ID":"20240321173915-7qq1am0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20240321173915-7qq1am0","updated":"20250918203732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240321173915-3mvnoyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321173915-3mvnoyp","updated":"20250918203732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意 Label 的层级关系"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250918204349-vjue8t9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204349-vjue8t9","updated":"20250918204349"}}]}